{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_037_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c539e45acff84c3191adb659be41ffdda3de576a1e06d104e595b14346e581d6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b5974fa0b3f4b568dd5ca623e13d9c9766f8e0b817cf10c576618be3e375dfc",
      "text": "……其实我刚才看的，是一篇国外的化学论文啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f7b4e212f405ab168ccfaca92c0cd0662a5c7af6a1955f543a9f75340807e10",
      "text": "毕竟化学日新月异，经常会让人感叹“居然还能这样！”\n其实出乎意料地有趣哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db90c3981deeaa6052ca8990dc4739879c3782565d23e001db31448542de76d3",
      "text": "我自己有时候也会写写\n报告或者假说之类的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f5b67d974c59f9e1aee5f6e13a045b4d44c5e8e9507d9b85b8ab24098b07a39",
      "text": "啊，不，纯粹属于兴趣范围啦？\n完全没有打算投去哪里发表！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ee9c5fc543d954fad66be5f9b4a2925d69ed8eee7222b340bb8de9158eae0c",
      "text": "……原来如此。\n果然次郎先生是最合适的人选呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1283bea92b3d4ed0b07d3fa308c93041c596c5203111c24ffae1fce21f27d337",
      "text": "合适的人选？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c898dfb532ee916b4b25bc2dbd3fb44cd17c29552c1d1aaa6e2cc0e84a7e70db",
      "text": "刚才跟我商谈的对方，\n其实是某本科学杂志的相关人员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f78991079bef79c7128b26cb7e7a20554c52423ccf1873038c63e506decd169f",
      "text": "为了扩大读者群，他们发来了一份通告，\n希望能做一期化学家与偶像的对谈特辑……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5b13ef8edfe1bdc4f4defa823650e3667ac29a9110b762eb5e08c04058d7af4",
      "text": "我非常想推荐次郎先生去，\n您觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdde3c0783edecc53f6f3336cfd56ca7bc8fe36a2319faf9567a4e0f567ce390",
      "text": "哎……哎哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
